Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: Bibliograph Maintainers <maintainers@olamaelcu.net>
Homepage: https://biblio.livtet.olamaelcu.net
Depends: adduser
Description: Bibliograph catalog search index (Tantivy)
 The loopback search service behind community.lexicon.media.book.searchEditions.
 It owns a Tantivy index derived from the catalog tables: the worker posts
 changed documents into it (public.search_dirty is the queue) and the edge
 queries it instead of scanning Postgres.
 .
 The index is not a source of truth. Losing it costs a rebuild from Postgres,
 never catalog data, and the edge keeps answering from Postgres when the service
 is down. It listens on 127.0.0.1 only; configuration lives in
 /etc/bibliograph/search.env and the index in /var/lib/bibliograph-search.
